:"period/eyewitness","url":"https://glessnerhouse.blogspot.com/2014/11/elbridge-keith-house.html","what_it_does_not_supply":["colour: the print is monochrome","a date: the print is undated, after the 1880s mansard","the north flank, the rear and the rear range","the south flank behind its front few metres"],"what_it_supplies":["the street front's composition: the canted corner bay, the porch and balcony, the window columns, the terrace and stoop, the cornice, the mansard and its dormers, and the bay's crown","the heights of the principal floor, both storeys' windows, the frieze and the cornice through the photograph's camera","the tone of the walls: a light smooth stone"]},"uses":["other_scene"]}
